---
import KusalaDailyAppLayout from "@/layouts/KusalaDailyAppLayout.astro";
---

<KusalaDailyAppLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  eyebrow="Kusala Daily"
  description="How Kusala Daily handles prayer progress, reader preferences, and personal data."
>
  <section class="kusala-section" aria-labelledby="privacy-summary-heading">
    <h2 id="privacy-summary-heading">No data collected</h2>
    <p>
      Kusala Daily does not collect, transmit, sell, share, or track personal
      data. The app has no account system, analytics, advertising, cloud service,
      or network feature.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="kusala-section" aria-labelledby="privacy-device-heading">
    <h2 id="privacy-device-heading">Information stored on your device</h2>
    <p>
      Prayer counts, the selected prayer, the last Paccayo section, and the
      reader text-size preference are stored locally in Apple system preferences
      so the app can restore your state. This information remains on the device
      unless the operating system includes it in a device backup.
    </p>
    <p>
      You can clear prayer progress from the app’s reset controls. Deleting the
      app removes its locally stored app data according to iOS and iPadOS
      behavior.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="kusala-section" aria-labelledby="privacy-services-heading">
    <h2 id="privacy-services-heading">Apple services</h2>
    <p>
      Apple may process information separately when you use the App Store,
      TestFlight, device backups, or operating-system services. Those services
      are governed by Apple’s policies and are not data collection by Kusala
      Daily.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="kusala-section" aria-labelledby="privacy-contact-heading">
    <h2 id="privacy-contact-heading">Questions</h2>
    <p>
      For a privacy question, use the <a href="/apps/kusala-daily/support/">Kusala Daily support page</a>
      and identify the request as privacy-related.
    </p>
    <p>Last updated: July 29, 2026.</p>
  </section>
</KusalaDailyAppLayout>
